 Z←CalculateStars OBSERVER;DATE;STARDATA;VE;BRIGHTVIS;AAE;STARCOORD
⍝ Calculates positions of stars for given location/time
⍝ OBSERVER is LAT,DATE,TIME
⍝ Z is VE BRIGHTVIS AAE STARCOORD
 DATE←OBSERVER[2]
 STARDATA←OBSERVER SKYPOS(DATE-Data.CATEPOCH)PRECESS Data.STARS
 VE←VISIBLE STARDATA
 BRIGHTVIS←Data.BRIGHT∧VE
 AAE←BRIGHTVIS⌿STARDATA
 STARCOORD←MAPCARTESIAN PROJECTION VE⌿STARDATA
 Z←VE BRIGHTVIS AAE STARCOORD
